  "description": "The CERN data\u2011curation team has recorded a new authorship assertion for the record identified by INSPIRE\u202fID\u202f1234567. According to the entry created on 14\u202fJune\u202f2026 at 12:34\u202fUTC, the work is linked to the researcher whose ORCID identifier is\u202f0000\u20110002\u20111825\u20110097, indicating that the INSPIRE record is authored by that ORCID holder. The claim carries a certainty score of\u202f0.92, reflecting a high confidence level in the association.\n\nThis assessment was performed by Dr. Alice\u202fSmith, acting in her capacity as a cataloguer. Dr.\u202fSmith verified the claim manually (human\u2011generated) and documented the result for the CERN repository."
